(a) whether Government has assessed the impact of recent labour and social security reforms on women's workforce participation, including FLFPR trends during the last five years;
(b) whether provisions under the Labour Codes enabling women's employment, including night shifts with safeguards, have been operationalised by States/UTs;
(c) the measures taken to ensure compliance with equal remuneration, maternity benefits, crèche facilities, POSH provisions and the She-Box portal; and
(d) whether Government proposes to strengthen skilling and employment initiatives to enhance women's workforce participation, particularly in aspirational districts?

(a) whether Government has undertaken initiatives to enhance citizen awareness against telecom frauds, spoofed calls and fraudulent communications;
(b) the details of awareness campaigns and outreach programmes conducted through Sanchar Saathi and other platforms;
(c) whether Government proposes to strengthen integration of the Digital Intelligence Platform with banks and payment service providers for real-time fraud detection; and
(d) the steps taken to strengthen citizen-centric reporting and grievance redressal mechanisms for victims of telecom-enabled frauds?

(a) the major initiatives undertaken to prevent AI-enabled cyber crimes and protect citizens' digital identities;
(b) the measures taken by the Indian Cyber Crime Coordination Centre (I4C) to strengthen public awareness, reporting mechanisms and institutional capacity;
(c) whether any framework has been developed for coordinated action among law enforcement agencies, financial institutions and digital service providers to counter such crimes; and
(d) the further steps proposed to strengthen cyber resilience and promote safe use of emerging technologies?

(a) whether preparatory activities for Census 2027, including House Listing and Housing Census, have commenced across all States and Union Territories;
(b) the State-wise status of digital infrastructure and self-enumeration facilities for Census, 2027;
(c) whether training programmes have been conducted for census functionaries and supervisors;
(d) whether any funds have been released to States and Union Territories for census-related activities; and
(e) if so, the details thereof?

(a) whether Government has undertaken initiatives to promote the wind energy sector and achieve the targeted capacity addition;
(b) the measures taken to strengthen domestic manufacturing, enhance competitiveness and promote exports of wind energy equipment;
(c) whether additional measures are proposed to augment transmission infrastructure, improve forecasting and facilitate grid integration of wind energy; and
(d) whether any offshore wind zones and other high-resource areas have been identified for accelerated development and if so, the details thereof?
